WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.872
Learn to solve multi-step word problems involving the four basic operations

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:11.510
A class collected 21 blue and 6 green bottle tops, then shared them into 4 equal

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:17.321
groups. How many complete bottle tops per group? The answer is 6. 21 plus 6 equals

00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:21.679
27; divide by 4 for 6 complete items (with 3 left over).

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:28.372
A class has 21 blue beads and 17 red beads. It makes 5 equal necklaces. How many

00:00:28.372 --> 00:00:32.837
whole items can each get? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:41.721
The answer is 7. 21 plus 17 equals 38; 38 divided by 5 gives 7 each with 3 left.
